        "body_GFGLLU": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Napapijri's journey from makers of travel bags to an authentic lifestyle brand spans almost four decades. From the meaning of its name, to the iconic Norwegian flag, Napapijri's original inspiration came from the timeless appeal of polar expeditions.To this day, collection after collection, the brand strives to capture the essence of exploration as a cultural and aesthetic experience through a distinct style applied to functional apparel.</p>"
